{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1149693-random-foci-generator","id":1149693,"title":"Random Foci Generator","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-10-14T08:39:57-07:00","id":1149693,"title":"Random Foci Generator","content":"So I used the Paradigm, Praxises and Tools exposed in Mage 20 (both the core rulebook and the Book of Secrets), and I created a random generator. I thought it could be a way to generate original types of magick, and while the results are often a bit far-fetched, I find it satisfying on the whole.<br /> <br /> Let me me guess what you guys think !<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orteil.dashnet.org/randomgen/?gen=4rY1ep6Z\" target=\"_blank\">http://orteil.dashnet.org/randomgen/?gen=4rY1ep6Z</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11431-adrasalieth","name":"Adrasalieth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11431_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"108"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-14T09:07:54-07:00","id":1149706,"title":"","content":"I would suggest adding a note that amount will generate 'X' sets of paradigm, praxises and tools, where X is a number.<br /> <br /> Given how closely practices and instruments tie to some paradigms, there might be some odd results. However, sometimes you need quick inspiration, so this generator would help with that.<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[